id: pm-r2xv95
title: "GH-1512: define count-based context completion rounding at half-percent boundaries"
description: "Published-release report:29 closed children of200 are rendered as14 percent because the floating-point product lies below the half boundary. Source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1512 . Exact counts are correct; define the rounding contract before changing percentages."
