risk: medium
confidence: medium
resolution: Multiply integer counts before division and reuse one completion calculation for focus progress and both Markdown hierarchy levels. Preserve exact numerator and denominator facts.
expected_result: 29closed descendants out of200 render15percent consistently; neighboring half boundaries follow the same documented rule.
actual_result: "The real200-child fixture passes SDK CLI MCP and Markdown at15percent. Neighboring28/20029/20030/20057/200199/200 controls pass. PR1515 code head7ba76fd6ce2d43937e0c490343e8c9e195d7a82c: CI39376468501 passed all required hosted checks; exact coverage lines66214/66214 statements69818/69818 functions14387/14387 branches53652/53652. DeepScan0new and CodeFactor0annotations. Final review test improvement passes the focused linked transport suite. Original failed local performance and mutation-timeout receipts remain failed."
