  "2026-10-19T16:31:12.454Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: fresh all-open and in-progress inventories, request-specific searches and complete earlier all-status intake show no exact active report owner. Full live predecessor metadata and history confirm completed prior scope; preserve it and create this narrowly reported follow-up. Intake only: unclaimed and open; no implementation or independent reproduction claimed."
  "2026-10-20T05:04:52.848Z","harness:codex","Independent pre-fix proof created200 descendants through supported mutation paths,29closed: context reports14 rather than the required15. Integer count multiplication now precedes division, and focus/progress/Markdown hierarchy share the same calculation. Added neighboring28/20029/20030/20057/200199/200 unit controls. Integration setup now creates the200 children directly through public runCreate to retain real persistence/history while avoiding repeated transport bootstrap; acceptance still reads SDK CLI and MCP."
  "2026-10-20T06:15:35.648Z","harness:codex","The real200-child fixture passes SDK CLI MCP and Markdown at15percent. Neighboring28/20029/20030/20057/200199/200 controls pass. PR1515 code head7ba76fd6ce2d43937e0c490343e8c9e195d7a82c: CI39376468501 passed all required hosted checks; exact coverage lines66214/66214 statements69818/69818 functions14387/14387 branches53652/53652. DeepScan0new and CodeFactor0annotations. Final review test improvement passes the focused linked transport suite. Original failed local performance and mutation-timeout receipts remain failed."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-20T05:11:38.972Z","harness:codex",Count-based percentages should multiply exact integer counts before division; dividing first can move an exact half-percent below the rounding boundary. Route every textual and structured progress surface through the same calculation and retain numerator/denominator facts.
